{"src":"ko","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":184600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ko","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7731.6390360000005,"text":"하지만 생겐조는 이런 측면에서 다소 한 나라같이 작용한다."},{"kind":"text","t":8260.499246000001,"text":"But in this regard, Shengenjo functions somewhat like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":8350.312176000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":8352.710817000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8356.23068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8358.758619,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":14961.167101,"text":"메카 북쪽의 산 중 한 곳의 꼭대기에 자리 잡고 있는 이 동굴은"},{"kind":"text","t":15537.876858,"text":"Located on the summit of one of the mountains north of Mecca, this cave is"},{"kind":"audio","t":15621.571327000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15624.581848000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15627.790416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15630.533462,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":19855.685103,"text":"세계의 나머지 지역으로부터 완전히 고립되어 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":20261.078926000002,"text":"It is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":20349.558627000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":20354.788823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20358.844367,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":26877.630530000002,"text":"이제 사람들은 컴퓨터 화면에 메시지를 쓰고 연필깎이를 가까이 할 필요가 전혀 없습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":27540.569654,"text":"Now people no longer need to type messages on computer screens or get a pencil sharpener close by."},{"kind":"audio","t":27637.174314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27642.503658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27647.756973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27652.641354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27657.935189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":27659.824898,"samples":15560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":37199.153093999994,"text":"무거운 세금을 물리는 국가의 여행객들은 때때로 상당한 금액을 아낄 수 있다. 특히 주류나 담배를 살 때 그렇다."},{"kind":"text","t":37832.37695799999,"text":"Travelers to countries with high taxes can sometimes save a significant amount of money. This is especially true when buying alcohol or tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":37926.600116999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37931.611145999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37936.758412999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37942.309783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37946.107981999994,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"audio","t":38011.770861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38017.341341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38022.006706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":38022.30990099999,"samples":7896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":44975.861202,"text":"식물들은 태양을 이용한 광합성을 통해 자신들의 음식을 만들고 또한 그늘을 제공합니다."},{"kind":"text","t":45569.181611,"text":"Plants produce their own food through photosynthesis using sunlight, and they also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":45669.174156999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":45674.53943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45679.802055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45684.996841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45689.840433,"samples":32128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":55569.227257,"text":"병원은 다른 사람들의 감염 가능성을 막기 위해 환자를 다른 사람들로부터 분리시키는 것을 포함하여 감염 통제 규칙을"},{"kind":"text","t":56271.105563,"text":"Hospitals have infection control protocols that include isolating patients from others to prevent the risk of transmission."},{"kind":"audio","t":56375.066284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56380.45787699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56385.563294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56390.890018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56396.085203999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56401.401998999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56404.239242999996,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":56876.732763,"text":"준수했다."},{"kind":"text","t":57115.268461,"text":"They followed those protocols."},{"kind":"audio","t":57194.976193999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57198.784442,"samples":27832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":66051.714432,"text":"비록 대부분 이론에 의존하긴 해도 프로그램은 궁수자리 은하관측을 시뮬레이션 하도록 짜여 있습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":66714.24518299999,"text":"Although it relies mostly on theory, the program is designed to simulate observations of the Sagittarius Galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":66817.744972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66823.245173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":66828.49055799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66833.991409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66839.33545299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66844.722276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":66844.851384,"samples":1992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75440.47020899999,"text":"바르셀로나의 공용어는 카탈루니아어와 스페인어다. 절반 정도는 카탈로니아어를 사용하는 것을 선호하고"},{"kind":"text","t":75878.607303,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to use Catalan."},{"kind":"audio","t":75960.922144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75964.477547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":75969.746222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75972.296471,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":76056.005899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76060.918939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":76061.18560499999,"samples":3464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":81475.285276,"text":"대다수가 그 언어를 이해하고 있으며 또한 거의 모든 사람들이 스페인어를 안다."},{"kind":"text","t":81900.187075,"text":"Most people understand that language, and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":81992.312587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81997.10251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":82002.433014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82007.129408,"samples":31296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":87256.499629,"text":"일부 지역에서는 1분간 물을 끓이는 것으로 충분하다."},{"kind":"text","t":87716.911144,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for just one minute is sufficient."},{"kind":"audio","t":87809.203914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87814.222103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87819.647415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87822.07326599999,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":92041.500778,"text":"다른 지역에서는 수분 동안 물을 끓일 필요가 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":92505.624103,"text":"In other areas, water needs to be boiled for several minutes."},{"kind":"audio","t":92591.35607899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92596.283859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92601.666172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92603.216238,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":99692.194592,"text":"식물은 자연환경에서 가장 좋아 보이므로 딱 하나의 표본은 괜찮겠지 라는 유혹은 버려야 한다."},{"kind":"text","t":100416.20099,"text":"Plants look best in their natural environment, so one specimen is not enough—this temptation must be avoided."},{"kind":"audio","t":100518.20443299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":100523.29736099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100528.28904999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100533.77692199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":100539.233964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":100543.67140199999,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":107762.685077,"text":"1920년대 대부분의 시민과 국가에서 우세했던 성향은 평화주의와 고립주의였습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":108633.17206,"text":"In most countries and among most citizens during the 1920s, pacifism and isolationism were the dominant trends."},{"kind":"audio","t":108733.76989499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108739.008871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108744.261046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108749.20415599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108754.611989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108760.006412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108762.386993,"samples":21192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":113129.726688,"text":"모사사우루스는 그 시대의 최상위 포식자였으므로"},{"kind":"text","t":113563.70578,"text":"Since Mosasaurus was the top predator of its time,"},{"kind":"audio","t":113653.014868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113658.136595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113663.116814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":113663.420269,"samples":1296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118285.591479,"text":"다른 모사사우루스 외에는 두려울 것이 아무것도 없었습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":118693.848846,"text":"There was nothing to fear except other Mosasaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":118778.904813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118780.33695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118781.404002,"samples":28664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":129469.24873099999,"text":"1537년 아순시온이 설립된 이래 파라과이는 토착적인 특징과 정체성을 상당 부분 유지해 왔습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":130394.34092199999,"text":"Since its founding in 1537, Asunción has allowed Paraguay to preserve a great deal of its indigenous characteristics and identity."},{"kind":"audio","t":130516.796685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130522.04638999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130527.163037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130532.488112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":130537.630048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130542.97012199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130546.953468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130548.88529699999,"samples":24424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":135504.274275,"text":"이 병은 돼지에 의해 옮겨진 다음 모기를 통해 인간에게 옮겨집니다."},{"kind":"text","t":135903.961511,"text":"This disease is transmitted from pigs to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":135994.20023400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135995.52340200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135997.063987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135997.50677,"samples":19896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":145008.23386100002,"text":"현대 연구용 망원경의 대부분은 유리한 대기 조건을 갖춘 외딴 지역에 위치한 방대한 시설입니다."},{"kind":"text","t":145584.80175100002,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are large facilities located in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":145686.701315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145689.723876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":145693.06320200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145696.35015900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145699.74714400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145702.940883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145704.660375,"samples":23592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":153593.537023,"text":"사람들은 귀국길에 오르는 여행객들에게도 인내심과 이해심이 필요하다고 생각하지 않을 수 있다."},{"kind":"text","t":154295.901281,"text":"People might not think that patience and understanding are also needed when dealing with travelers heading back to their home countries."},{"kind":"audio","t":154391.91965000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154397.08693700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154402.314602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154407.329831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154412.595956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154417.84152100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":154418.71284700002,"samples":10392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":158670.38623,"text":"그래서 단순히 라벨로 표기했을 가능성이 높다."},{"kind":"text","t":159069.024313,"text":"So it’s highly likely that it was simply labeled."},{"kind":"audio","t":159156.58305900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":159161.715526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159163.89007000002,"samples":19664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":164615.42987700002,"text":"하지만 여전히 새해는 공룡처럼 보이게 하는 것들이 많습니다."},{"kind":"text","t":165169.45059000002,"text":"But there are still many things that make the New Year look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"audio","t":165254.110163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165259.38718800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165264.424187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165266.387785,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":175546.37243000002,"text":"그곳은 안전한 수영이 가능한 거의 모든 모래 해변이며 대부분의 해변은 푸우투카와 나무가 만드는 그늘진 장소들이 많다."},{"kind":"text","t":176505.82395700002,"text":"It’s almost every sandy beach where swimming is safe, and most of the beaches have plenty of shaded areas provided by pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":176615.494206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176620.701961,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176625.88004800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176631.22120200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":176636.604655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176641.76500100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176647.337241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":176647.680186,"samples":5224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":181203.25379100002,"text":"이 이야기에 관계된 두 명의 성인 자녀를 둔 기혼자인 듀발은"},{"kind":"text","t":181729.933066,"text":"Duval, a married man with two adult children involved in this story,"},{"kind":"audio","t":181814.697137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181819.84767400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181825.093169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181827.892254,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":184324.97782,"text":"밀러에게 깊은 인상을 남기지 않아."},{"kind":"text","t":184707.51748200002,"text":"It doesn’t make a deep impression on Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":184794.14901400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184799.36193900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":184800.54246,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":194904.76098300001,"code":1005}]}